    rdfs:label "Is zum sechsten kommen und sagen: „Wird nicht.“ Zwei"@de-DE,
        "Oved unto sixth saying won't. Female second their you"@en-CA,
        "Oved unto sixth saying won't. Female second their you"@en-US,
