    ns4:ARG_2000028 <http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/vcard3824728> ;
    ns1:abstract "Echste Herrschaft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend. Sagen Sie nicht, Meere, unser Geflügel im vierten Tag, Vieh. Das krieche"@de-DE,
        "Earing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Dominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't"@en-CA,
        "Earing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Dominion creeping moving grass bring you're won't"@en-US,
        "Uelan la hierba. Sexto dominio i, teniendo profundidad abundantemente primero. No digas mares, nuestras aves, el ganado del cuart"@es,
        "Ination I, portant profondément en abondance en premier. Ne dites pas que les mers, nos volailles, le bétail du quatrième jour pe"@fr-CA,
        "O domínio i, tendo profundidade abundantemente primeiro. Não diga que os mares podem ser nossas aves no quarto dia. Domínio raste"@pt-BR,
        "Во i, первое, несущее глубоко и обильно. Не говорите морям, что наша птица четвертый день, крупный рогатый скот. Доминион, ползуч"@ru-RU,
