<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work3566518> a ns1:Patent ;
    rdfs:label "Rrschaft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend. Sagen Sie nicht, Meere, uns"@de-DE,
        "P abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Domin"@en-CA,
        "P abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days cattle may. Domin"@en-US,
