    rdfs:label "Ut. Sechste Herrschaft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend. Sagen Sie nich"@de-DE,
        ", bearing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days catt"@en-CA,
        ", bearing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days catt"@en-US,
