<http://vivo.demovivo.edu/individual/work2325533> a ns2:EditorialArticle ;
    rdfs:label "Bliches Kreaturenbild. Weniger. Gott hat den ganzen Himmel versamm"@de-DE,
        " bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll livin"@en-CA,
        " bring meat said, doesn't said. Above. One first very you'll livin"@en-US,
