    rdfs:label "Echste Herrschaft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend. Sagen Sie"@de-DE,
        "Earing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days"@en-CA,
        "Earing deep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth days"@en-US,
