    rdfs:label "Errschaft i, zuerst tief und reichlich tragend. Sagen"@de-DE,
        "Ep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth d"@en-CA,
        "Ep abundantly first. Don't said seas our fowl fourth d"@en-US,
